{
  "title": "Yellowed Garlicky Malaysian New Potatoes Hash",
  "description": "A garlicky and molten Malaysian dish featuring new potatoes and puff pastry, inspired by nostalgic flavors, this hash is cooked to perfection on a comal and is ayurvedic-tamasic-friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Malaysian",
